            <div style="margin-top:20px;font:400 22px/1.2 'DM Serif Display',serif;color:#F6F4E9">What did you do?</div>
            <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font:400 13.5px/1.5 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:rgba(201,212,194,.78)">Sessions and actions, logged against the signal.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:30px 26px 28px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(6,11,7,.5);border:1px solid rgba(228,240,214,.08)">
            <span style="font:500 10.5px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#DCEC85">03 · REVIEW</span>
            <div style="margin-top:20px;font:400 22px/1.2 'DM Serif Display',serif;color:#F6F4E9">Did it work?</div>
            <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font:400 13.5px/1.5 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:rgba(201,212,194,.78)">Next month’s check-in shows what moved.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:30px 26px 28px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(230,199,126,.07);border:1px solid rgba(230,199,126,.22)">
