            <div style="margin-top:20px;font:400 22px/1.2 'DM Serif Display',serif;color:#F6F4E9">Can you prove it?</div>
            <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font:400 13.5px/1.5 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:rgba(201,212,194,.78)">A dated trail. Aggregated, never individual.</p>
