            <h3 style="margin:14px 0 0;font:400 clamp(28px,3.2vw,40px)/1.1 'DM Serif Display',serif;letter-spacing:-.4px;color:#F6F4E9;text-wrap:pretty">Find psychosocial hazards early. Show your controls are working.</h3>
