            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:18px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(228,240,214,.08)"><span style="flex:none;font:400 40px/1 'DM Serif Display',serif;color:#EFDCAE">51%</span><span style="font:400 13px/1.45 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:rgba(201,212,194,.78)">of audited Queensland resource sites had a psychosocial risk assessment (2026).</span></div>
